- **Layering and cycles:** Neither moved namespace requires `yin.repl*`, including conditional branches. Source dependency traversal found no transitive REPL dependency or cycle involving either namespace.
- **Consumers:** The complete 13-file require inventory is updated, with aliases preserved and no stale active `:refer` or qualified uses. Remaining old-name matches are document pointers and synthetic detector fixtures. Generated linker Dart files use the relocated imports; test discovery derives the moved test namespaces from source. Node/Dart execution remains unverified.
